&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;BW ESS is seeking an experienced Senior Treasury Manager to take ownership of the Group&#39;s treasury activities across its international corporate entities, project SPVs and joint ventures.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As BW ESS continues to grow, the complexity and importance of treasury is increasing materially. This role will bring together activities currently undertaken across different parts of the organisation, establish clear ownership and controls, and build a scalable treasury capability for the Group.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a senior, hands-on role for someone who can both design the right treasury framework and make sure it operates effectively day to day. We are looking for candidates with real ownership experience in complex, multi-entity, multi-currency environments, ideally gained in energy, renewables, infrastructure, utilities or another project- and SPV-based business.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
